  "comment": "Install sudo apt-get install xinetd tftpd tftp Buat vi /etc/xinetd.d/tftp isi dengan service tftp { protocol = udp port = 69 socket_type = dgram wait = yes user = nobody server = /usr/sbin/in.tftpd server_args = /tftpboot disable = no } Buat folder /tftpboot sudo mkdir /tftpboot sudo chmod -R 777 /tftpboot sudo chown -R nobody /tftpboot Restart xinetd service. sudo /etc/init.d/xinetd restart",
